  "description": "Nested along the spectacular Wild Atlantic Way, This 3 bedroom home offers a unique oppurtunity to enjoy a coastal living in one of Clares most breathtaking locations.  \n\nSituated in the heart of Loop Head, the property combines comfort, space, and stunning natural surroundings. The accommodation comprises a bright and welcoming living room, a well-appointed kitchen and dining area, three generously sized bedrooms, and a bathroom. The home benefits from ample natural light throughout, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere\n\nOutside, the property enjoys a private garden with plenty of space for outdoor dining, entertaining, or simply relaxing while taking in the peaceful countryside setting. The nearby coastline, rugged cliffs, sandy beaches, and famous Loop Head Lighthouse are all within easy reach, making this an ideal location for nature lovers and outdoor enthusiasts.\n\nViewing of this property is highly recommended. * We are requesting expressions of interest by emaiI only. To register your interest in this property, please fill your details in to the Contact Seller box on the right of this ad in order to receive an application form. * Disclaimer: Whilst every care has been taken in the preparation of these particulars, and they are believed to be correct, they are not warranted and intending lessees should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of information given.",
